    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313">

                <pb facs="0582" n="562" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg562"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 19, 1864</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to recur to your two
                    notes of the 5th instant, one of which relates to the detention of three of the
                    crew of the British schooner Sallie, in jail at New York, and the other to that
                    of the master and crew of the British schooner Sylvanus, at Fort Lafayette, and
                    to inform your lordship that, at the recommendation of this department, the
                    Secretary of the Navy has directed their discharge from custody.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
